---
title: Pumpkin Fluff Dessert
author: Mildred McKinzie
category: Desserts
source: Loving Memories of Mildred
---

@crushed ginger snaps{24}
@melted butter{0.5%cup}
@sugar{0.75%cup}
@marshmallows{1%lb}
@pumpkin{2%cups}
@cinnamon{1%tsp}
@ginger{1%tsp}
@salt{0.5%tsp}
@whipped cream{2%cups}

==Crust==
Mix crushed ginger snaps, melted butter, and sugar. Put in bottom of 9X13 pan.

==Filling==
Melt marshmallows, pumpkin and spices together. Cool thoroughly. Fold in whipped cream and put on the crumb crust. Refrigerate.
